BT 1 0 0 1 0 50.95 Tm /F3+0 7.25 Tf 9.7 TL (Ys Goldt is a writer and multidisciplinary artist working across literary) Tj T* (and speculative fiction, fantasy, romance, interactive media and design. Her) Tj T* (fiction frequently explores love, memory, identity, solitude and the quiet) Tj T* (ways people alter one another. Whether writing historical settings or) Tj T* (invented worlds, her work begins with character and returns to a central) Tj T* (question: what does it cost to truly let another person in?) Tj T* ET
